  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"note\"><i><b>Note:</b> this page is about the retriever puppy, not to be confused with the <a href=\"/wiki/retriever-2463\" title=\"Retriever\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">retriever dog</a>.</i></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/49/Retriever_Puppy.png/revision/latest?cb=20150912144202\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Retriever puppy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Retriever puppy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Retriever puppy</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 35 • 44</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Needs </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Any one: <span>Bacon</span><span title=\"Bacon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-2267\" title=\"Bacon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Bacon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20191025193433\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span><span>Lamb Chop</span><span title=\"Lamb chop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/lamb-chop-36740\" title=\"Lamb Chop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lamb Chop\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/72/Lamb_Chop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20260512222547\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 6 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 35</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Green voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>36 <span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Blue voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>8</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 780</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Retriever puppies</b> are pet <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a>. The first puppy is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 35 and the second one at level 44.\n</p><p>They give players <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points in exchange for <a href=\"/wiki/bacon-2267\" title=\"Bacon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bacon</a>  or <a href=\"/wiki/lamb-chop-36740\" title=\"Lamb Chop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lamb chops</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ab/Retriever_Puppy_Asleep.png/revision/latest?cb=20150406173925\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Retriever Puppy Asleep\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/50/Retriever_Puppy_Tired.png/revision/latest?cb=20150425103447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Retriever Puppy Tired\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Puppy_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713110633\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Puppy house\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puppy house\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Puppy house</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Each puppy costs 36 green <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a> and 8 blue ones, or 780 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. They must be placed near a <a href=\"/wiki/puppy-house-18339\" title=\"Puppy House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">puppy house</a> to be bought. Players can have two retriever puppies.\n</p><p>Puppies and puppy houses can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shop</a>. <span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Feeding</b></span></h3>\n<p>When given <a href=\"/wiki/bacon-2267\" title=\"Bacon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bacon</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/lamb-chop-36740\" title=\"Lamb Chop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lamb chops</a>, the puppies will eat it and then roam the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> for six hours before finally falling asleep. Players can immediately wake them up to receive 35 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> per animal. Puppies stay asleep otherwise.\n</p><p>Puppies which have been woken up but are not fed for a long while cannot fall asleep and wander around their shelter looking very sleepy and tired.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Waking puppies one by one instead of all at once can increase your chance of getting a random <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-supplies-14729\" title=\"Category:Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supply item</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-pets-17088\" title=\"Category:Pets\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pets</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/agami-heron-35866\" title=\"Agami Heron\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Agami Heron\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/american-flamingo-36078\" title=\"American Flamingo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"American Flamingo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/anatolian-donkey-10430\" title=\"Anatolian Donkey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Anatolian Donkey\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andalusian-donkey-11356\" title=\"Andalusian Donkey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andalusian Donkey\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andalusian-horse-2698\" title=\"Andalusian Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andalusian Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andean-flamingo-36051\" title=\"Andean Flamingo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andean Flamingo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/appaloosa-horse-35301\" title=\"Appaloosa Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Appaloosa Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"118\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/australian-pelican-35824\" title=\"Australian Pelican\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Australian Pelican\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bay-horse-2586\" title=\"Bay Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bay Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/black-bunny-27437\" title=\"Black Bunny\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Black Bunny\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/black-swan-36279\" title=\"Black Swan\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Black Swan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/black-necked-swan-36281\" title=\"Black-necked Swan\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Black-necked Swan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/blue-peacock-35256\" title=\"Blue Peacock\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue Peacock\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/blue-and-gold-macaw-36466\" title=\"Blue-and-Gold Macaw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue-and-Gold Macaw\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/brown-peacock-35257\" title=\"Brown Peacock\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Brown Peacock\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/brown-pelican-35828\" title=\"Brown Pelican\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Brown Pelican\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/calico-cat-2582\" title=\"Calico Cat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Calico Cat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/calico-kitten-19435\" title=\"Calico Kitten\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Calico Kitten\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/capped-heron-35830\" title=\"Capped Heron\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Capped Heron\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/dalmatian-pelican-35829\" title=\"Dalmatian Pelican\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dalmatian Pelican\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/fjord-pony-36438\" title=\"Fjord Pony\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fjord Pony\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/fluffy-bunny-15060\" title=\"Fluffy Bunny\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fluffy Bunny\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/greater-flamingo-36140\" title=\"Greater Flamingo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Greater Flamingo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/hound-2580\" title=\"Hound\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hound\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/hound-puppy-20185\" title=\"Hound Puppy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hound Puppy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/huacaya-alpaca-36822\" title=\"Huacaya Alpaca\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Huacaya Alpaca\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/husky-36493\" title=\"Husky\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Husky\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"131\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/husky-puppy-36514\" title=\"Husky Puppy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Husky Puppy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/hyacinth-macaw-36463\" title=\"Hyacinth Macaw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hyacinth Macaw\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/keel-billed-toucan-35407\" title=\"Keel-billed Toucan\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Keel-billed Toucan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lipizzaner-horse-21768\" title=\"Lipizzaner Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lipizzaner Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/major-mitchell-s-cockatoo-35580\" title=\"Major Mitchell&amp;#39;s Cockatoo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Major Mitchell&amp;#39;s Cockatoo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/malamute-36492\" title=\"Malamute\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Malamute\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"119\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/malamute-puppy-36623\" title=\"Malamute Puppy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Malamute Puppy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"109\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/palomino-horse-2588\" title=\"Palomi