  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}{{note|this page is about the retriever puppy, not to be confused with the [[Retriever|retriever dog]].}}\n[[File:Retriever Puppy.png|200px|left|Retriever puppy]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Animals|Animal]]\n |level = 35 • 44\n |needs = Any one: {{Infoicon|bacon|big|link=Bacon}}{{Infoicon|lambchop|big|link=Lamb Chop}}\n |time = every 6 h\n |cost= {{Infoicon|greenv|link=Voucher}}36 {{Infoicon|bluev|link=Voucher}}8\n |xp = 35\n |dia = 780\n}}\n'''Retriever puppies''' are pet [[animals]]. The first puppy is unlocked at [[experience]] level 35 and the second one at level 44.\n\nThey give players [[experience]] points in exchange for [[bacon]]  or [[Lamb Chop|lamb chops]].\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Appearance'''===\n{{BigIcon|Retriever Puppy Asleep}}{{BigIcon|Retriever Puppy Tired}}\n----\n==='''Buying'''===\n[[File:Puppy House.png|150px|left|Puppy house]]\nEach puppy costs 36 green [[voucher]]s and 8 blue ones, or 780 [[diamond]]s. They must be placed near a [[Puppy House|puppy house]] to be bought. Players can have two retriever puppies.\n\nPuppies and puppy houses can be bought from the [[Shop]]. {{Infoicon|shop|bigger|link=Shop}}\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Feeding'''===\nWhen given [[bacon]] or [[Lamb Chop|lamb chops]], the puppies will eat it and then roam the [[farm]] for six hours before finally falling asleep. Players can immediately wake them up to receive 35 {{Infoicon|xp}} per animal. Puppies stay asleep otherwise.\n\nPuppies which have been woken up but are not fed for a long while cannot fall asleep and wander around their shelter looking very sleepy and tired.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Waking puppies one by one instead of all at once can increase your chance of getting a random [[:Category:Supplies|supply item]].\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Retriever-Welpe\n|es = Perrito cobrador\n|fr = Retriever Puppy\n|it = Cucciolo di retriever\n|no = Retrievervalp\n}}\n[[ru:Щенок ретривера]]\n\n[[Category:Puppies]]",
  "wikitextHash": "5b648e592a89a7c7bfde133bce8eed7f508ef9ad5d31e96ddecc82b5d3fa1919"
}
